# Applies to `docker build -f training/Dockerfile .` and replaces the root
# .dockerignore, which is written for the API image and excludes training/.
# An allowlist: the context is the whole repo, but the image needs only these.
*
!training/train.py
!training/model_eval.py
!training/export.py
!training/requirements.txt
!cli/pyproject.toml
!cli/README.md
!cli/LICENSE
!cli/heulistic
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
